  "comments": "<p>The production of Cruzeiro Novo (NCr$) coins continued after the change of monetary standard to Cruzeiro (Cr$) in 1970.&nbsp;<br>Therefore, the Central Bank of Brazil considers coins after 1970 to belong to the new Cruzeiro monetary unit. Coins minted in 1967 entered circulation in 1968.</p><p>The Cruzeiro Novo coins (NCr$), 1967-1969), continued in use until 1980 alongside the Cruzeiro coins</p>",
